# bundled plugin variant  ->  GStreamer version it is built against  ->  trust
# The variant is named purely by GStreamer version, because that is what the plugin
# binds to (ABI soname + LG's smart-property API) - stable within a webOS major and
# identical across TV models. Trust is per GStreamer version: once a variant is
# confirmed on real hardware, every TV on that version counts as verified.
# columns: <variant>  <gstreamer>  <verified|experimental>
gst-1.18.2  1.18.2  verified
gst-1.16.2  1.16.2  experimental
